('Exit light Testing Melbourne', 'exit-light-testing-melbourne', 'Our team of experienced technicians are trained to do the Exit Light testing, Emergency Light Testing, Fire extinguisher testing including in inspection...', '<p>Our team of experienced technicians are trained to do the  Exit Light testing, Emergency Light Testing, Fire extinguisher testing including in inspection, reporting. We can also help in setting up a schedule for check up of exit light at regular intervals. Exit light testing, Visual and Defect Reports, Electrical Cord Testing, Fire Extinguisher, RCD/ Safety Switches, Three Phase Testing, Microwave Testing, Test and tag equipment, are our complementary services.</p>		
